msgid "No photo or PDF attached to read."
msgstr "Aucune photo ni PDF joint à lire."

#. module: bf_expense_ocr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_expense_ocr.res_config_settings_view_form_ocr
msgid ""
"Off, the receipt is read only on request. On, every attached photo goes to "
"the provider configured in the LLM gateway."
msgstr ""
"Éteint, le reçu n'est lu que sur demande. Allumé, chaque photo jointe part "
"vers le fournisseur configuré dans la passerelle LLM."

#. module: bf_expense_ocr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_expense_ocr.field_res_company__expense_ocr_auto
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_expense_ocr.field_res_config_settings__expense_ocr_auto
msgid ""
"Off, the receipt is read only when someone presses the button. On, every "
"photo attached to an expense is sent to the provider configured in the LLM "
"gateway as soon as it is uploaded."
msgstr ""
"Éteint, le reçu n'est lu que si quelqu'un appuie sur le bouton. Allumé, "
"chaque photo jointe à une dépense est envoyée au fournisseur configuré dans "
"la passerelle LLM dès son téléversement."

#. module: bf_expense_ocr
